{"gain":[{"c":"You gain nothing by speaking ill of others.","cn":"通过诋毁别人，你得不到什么。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269932 (CM) & #1358598 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269932"},{"c":"How do I gain weight?","cn":"我怎么才能发胖？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #815691 (CM) & #815690 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/815691"}],"gamble":[{"c":"After Tom lost his job, he started to gamble to cope with his depression.","cn":"湯姆失業後，為了排遣鬱悶的心情而開始了賭博。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7812230 (sharris123) & #2757133 (cienias)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7812230"}],"game":[{"c":"He got hurt in the game yesterday.","cn":"他昨天在這場比賽中受了傷。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #296886 (CK) & #802801 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/296886"},{"c":"He is likely to win the game.","cn":"他有可能赢得比赛。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #298286 (CK) & #332558 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/298286"}],"gang":[{"c":"The gang was planning a robbery.","cn":"這夥人計劃搶劫。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321223 (CK) & #866077 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321223"}],"garage":[{"c":"He backed his car into the garage.","cn":"他倒車入車庫。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #299045 (CK) & #887775 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/299045"},{"c":"I rented a house with a garage.","cn":"我租了一間有車庫的房子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #258413 (CK) & #888524 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/258413"}],"garbage":[{"c":"Don't forget to take out the garbage.","cn":"别忘了把垃圾拿出去。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3667566 (Hybrid) & #5091101 (mirrorvan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3667566"}],"garden":[{"c":"All the flowers in the garden withered.","cn":"所有花園裡的花朵都枯萎了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #278491 (CK) & #798292 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/278491"},{"c":"He found a ball in the garden.","cn":"他在花園裡找到了一顆球。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301703 (CK) & #875331 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301703"}],"gardening":[{"c":"She was reading a gardening manual.","cn":"她正在讀一本園藝手冊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #312709 (CK) & #861292 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/312709"}],"garlic":[{"c":"The food tasted slightly of garlic.","cn":"這個食物嚐起來有一點大蒜味。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #46144 (CM) & #848191 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/46144"},{"c":"Tom crushed the garlic.","cn":"汤姆捣碎了大蒜。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7446766 (Hybrid) & #7795216 (xinqian94)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7446766"}],"gas":[{"c":"Coal and natural gas are natural fuels.","cn":"煤和天然氣是天然燃料。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681036 (Source_VOA) & #899994 (kanaorange)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681036"},{"c":"How much is your monthly gas bill?","cn":"你每個月的瓦斯費多少錢？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #322354 (CK) & #881744 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/322354"}],"gasoline":[{"c":"There is a good chance that gasoline prices will go up.","cn":"油价上涨的可能性很高。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3818959 (CK) & #5650425 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3818959"}],"gate":[{"c":"The car is waiting at the gate.","cn":"車在門口等著。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264529 (CK) & #611940