CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #279237 (CK) & #796023 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/279237"}],"generation":[{"c":"My parents' generation went through the war.","cn":"我父母那一代经历过战争。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #252074 (CM) & #1360197 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/252074"}],"generous":[{"c":"Mother Nature is generous.","cn":"大自然很慷慨。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #792819 (U2FS) & #794063 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/792819"},{"c":"Tom is a very generous man.","cn":"湯姆是個大方的人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5825687 (CK) & #6068355 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5825687"}],"genetic":[{"c":"Should we use genetic engineering on people?","cn":"我们应该对人使用基因编辑吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681070 (Source_VOA) & #9970747 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681070"}],"geneva":[{"c":"The delegations of both countries met in Geneva.","cn":"两国代表团在日内瓦会面。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #325611 (CM) & #10157022 (yeyue)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/325611"}],"genius":[{"c":"He thought that he was a genius.","cn":"他認為他是個天才。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #298548 (CK) & #887886 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/298548"},{"c":"She was a genius in mathematics.","cn":"她是个数学天才。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #315283 (CK) & #787328 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/315283"}],"gentleman":[{"c":"A gentleman wouldn't do such a thing.","cn":"一个绅士是不会做这种事的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269707 (CK) & #346067 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269707"},{"c":"A true gentleman never betrays his friends.","cn":"一个真正的绅士不会出卖他的朋友。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #520132 (kebukebu) & #333581 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/520132"}],"gently":[{"c":"He put a hand gently on her shoulder.","cn":"他把他的手溫柔地放在她的肩上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #302775 (CK) & #766401 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/302775"},{"c":"He put his hand gently on her shoulder.","cn":"他把他的手溫柔地放在她的肩上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #838692 (Scott) & #766401 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/838692"}],"genuine":[{"c":"This might not be a genuine diamond.","cn":"這可能不是真的鑽石。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #788247 (hrin) & #781552 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/788247"}],"geography":[{"c":"He likes geography and history.","cn":"他喜欢地理和历史。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301471 (CK) & #528057 (biglion)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301471"}],"german":[{"c":"English and German are two related languages.","cn":"英語和德語是兩種相關的語言。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #460229 (jeanne) & #811858 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/460229"},{"c":"In addition to English, he speaks German.","cn":"除了英文，他還說德文。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26336 (CK) & #1740818 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26336"}],"germany":[{"c":"Germany was once an ally of Italy.","cn":"德国曾是意大利的同盟国。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #931532 (CK) & #472966 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/931532"},{"c":"The Rhine flows between France and Germany.","cn":"萊茵河流經法國和德國國界。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #452260 (enwilson) & #751683 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/452260"}],"get":[{"c":"Call me when you get settled in.","cn":"你安頓好就打電話給我。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #325187 (CK) & #865479 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/325187"},{"c":"Can I get you something to drink?","cn":"我可以帶喝的東西給你嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #25189 (CK) & #777700 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/25189"}],"get married":[{"c":"They decided to get married next month.","cn":"他們決定在下個月結婚。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #503818 (CK) & #896378 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/503818"},{"c":"They've decided to get married next month.","cn":"他們決定在下個月結婚。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #503817 (CK) & #896378 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/503817"}],"get off":[{"c":"I get off at the next station.","cn":"我下一站下车。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4430063 (eeyinn) & #375320 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4430063"},{"c":"I'll get off at the next station.","cn":"我下一站下车。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264242 (CK) & #375320 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264242"}],"get on":[{"c":"We happened to get on the same bus.","cn":"我们恰巧上了同一辆公交车。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #262972 (CK) & #1361991 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/262972"},{"c":"Get on the horse.","cn":"上马。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1256569 (CK) & #1411647 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1256569"}],"get up":[{"c":"I didn't want to get up early.","cn":"我不想很早起床。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259162 (CK) & #779462 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259162"},{"c":"I get up at 6:30 on school days.","cn":"他在上學的日子裡6:30起床。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6257186 (CK) & #6585422 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6257186"}],"ghost":[{"c":"You look like you've just seen a ghost.","cn":"你看起來就像見鬼了一樣。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4834392 (Hybrid) & #13523739 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4834392"},{"c":"I'm not a ghost.","cn":"我不是鬼。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #11040564 (CK) & #12420167 (jkyochen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11040564"}],"gift":[{"c":"A card was attached to the gift.","cn":"一張卡片被附在了禮物上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #274350 (CK) & #801487 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/274350"},{"c":"Do you have a gift shop here?","cn":"你們這裡有禮品店嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #434540 (lukaszpp) & #1261476 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/434540"}],"ginger":[{"c":"I hate the taste of ginger.","cn":"我讨厌姜味。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10164898 (ddnktr) & #10752804 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10164898"}],"giraffe":[{"c":"What sound does a giraffe make?","cn":"长颈鹿是怎么叫的？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2921563 (CK) & #8955171 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2921563"}],"girl":[{"c":"A beautiful girl sat next to me.","cn":"一個美麗的女孩坐在我旁邊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #318148 (CK) & #873213 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/318148"},{"c":"He introduced me to a pretty girl.","cn":"他把我介紹給了一個漂亮的女孩。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #303738 (CK) & #887761 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/303738"}],"give":[{"c":"Are you saying that you give up?","cn":"你是说你放弃了吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4811312 (khaledp16) & #4815166 (McMeao)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4811312"},{"c":"Can you give me your phone number?","cn":"你能給我你的電話號碼嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2226899 (CM) & #5689566 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2226899"}],"given":[{"c":"Each of them was given a prize.","cn":"他們每個人都被授獎了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #305880 (CK) & #801505 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/305880"},{"c":"Mother Teresa was given the Nobel prize.","cn":"特蕾莎修女被授予諾貝爾獎。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #32862 (CM) & #891326 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/32862"}],"glad":[{"c":"He is glad to hear the news.","cn":"他很高興聽到這個消息。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291147 (CK) & #804961 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291147"},{"c":"I am glad that you have succeeded.","cn":"我很高兴你们成功了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #17801 (CK) & #405042 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/17801"}],"glamorous":[{"c":"She's a glamorous girl.","cn":"她是个迷人的女孩子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #310767 (CK) & #2518656 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/310767"}],"glass":[{"c":"Could I have another glass of beer?","cn":"我可以再喝一杯啤酒嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #34840 (CK) & #868431 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/34840"},{"c":"Do you want a glass of soda?","cn":"你想來杯汽水嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1138343 (CM) & #3709573 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1138343"}],"glasses":[{"c":"He left his glasses at our 