 (sunnywqing)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/272543"},{"c":"Aren't you going to go with me?","cn":"你不要跟我一起走嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6099822 (CK) & #6624615 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6099822"}],"goal":[{"c":"He kicked the ball into the goal.","cn":"他把球踢進了球門。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #292705 (CK) & #879139 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/292705"},{"c":"Our team scored the first goal.","cn":"我们队进了第一个球。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7829881 (sharris123) & #7774760 (jiangche)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7829881"}],"god":[{"c":"God created the heaven and the earth.","cn":"上帝創造了天地。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269661 (CK) & #798251 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269661"},{"c":"God knows we did everything we could.","cn":"上帝知道我们做了我们所能做的事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #451772 (CM) & #444706 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/451772"}],"going":[{"c":"Are you going to attend the ceremony?","cn":"你會參加這個儀式嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264918 (CK) & #896674 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264918"},{"c":"Are you going to attend the meeting?","cn":"你要參加會議嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #22524 (CK) & #874470 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/22524"}],"gold":[{"c":"All that glitters is not gold.","cn":"發光的未必都是金子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #20086 (Swift) & #806207 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/20086"},{"c":"Gold is far heavier than water.","cn":"金子比水重得多。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #18583 (CK) & #332591 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/18583"}],"golf":[{"c":"Can I make a reservation for golf?","cn":"我能预定一下打高尔夫球吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #56358 (CK) & #336883 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/56358"},{"c":"He doesn't know how to play golf.","cn":"他不知道如何打高爾夫球。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289976 (CK) & #882513 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289976"}],"golfer":[{"c":"Tom is a good golfer.","cn":"汤姆是个不错的高尔夫球手。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7959143 (CK) & #8789699 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7959143"}],"good":[{"c":"A good idea suddenly came to me.","cn":"我的大腦裏突然出現了一個很好的想法。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7795833 (sharris123) & #5450984 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7795833"},{"c":"Did you have a good time yesterday?","cn":"你昨天玩得開心嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #244507 (CK) & #833200 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/244507"}],"goodbye":[{"c":"He left the house without saying goodbye.","cn":"他沒說再見就離開了房子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #387438 (CK) & #881527 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/387438"},{"c":"I'm afraid that I must say goodbye.","cn":"恐怕我必須說再見了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7217418 (CK) & #885677 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7217418"}],"goods":[{"c":"Many goods are now transported by air.","cn":"如今很多的货物都由飞机运送。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #241691 (CM) & #408272 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/241691"},{"c":"That company deals mainly in imported goods.","cn":"這公司主要做進口貨物的生意。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #49070 (CK) & #6098455 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/49070"}],"goof":[{"c":"Everybody likes to goof off.","cn":"所有人都喜欢偷懒。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4736823 (paper1n0) & #1417575 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4736823"}],"government":[{"c":"The Colombian government demanded more money.","cn":"哥伦比亚政府要了更多的钱。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #804358 (Source_VOA) & #805145 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/804358"},{"c":"The government should invest more money in agriculture.","cn":"政府应该加大对农业的投资。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1210696 (CK) & #2515316 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1210696"}],"governor":[{"c":"Everybody wished he had been elected governor.","cn":"每個人都希望他當選州長。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #22095 (CK) & #881076 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/22095"}],"grab":[{"c":"Anybody wanna grab something to eat with me?","cn":"有谁想一起去吃饭吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4197700 (Tigrin) & #12686147 (soueihin)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4197700"},{"c":"Grab a hold of the rope.","cn":"抓住繩子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #435753 (CK) & #844644 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/435753"}],"gracious":[{"c":"She is gracious to everyone.","cn":"她对谁都很和蔼可亲。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #315735 (mamat) & #333661 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/315735"}],"grade":[{"c":"He got a good grade in mathematics.","cn":"他數學得了一個好成績。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300236 (CK) & #804618 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300236"},{"c":"I got a good grade in English.","cn":"我的英文成績很好。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #256190 (CK) & #880997 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/256190"}],"graduate":[{"c":"He won't go on to graduate school.","cn":"他不會繼續去上研究所。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301261 (CK) & #887881 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301261"},{"c":"When did you graduate from high school?","cn":"你什麼時候中學畢業?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #66018 (CK) & #903008 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/66018"}],"grain":[{"c":"There isn't a grain of truth in what he says.","cn":"他说的话全不可信。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #286027 (CM) & #3523959 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/286027"}],"grammar":[{"c":"In Esperanto there are only 16 grammar rules.","cn":"世界語只有16個語法規則。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #752181 (Dejo) & #907492 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/752181"},{"c":"Grammar is a very complex thing.","cn":"语法是很复杂的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #401607 (CM) & #5640774 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/401607"}],"grammatical":[{"c":"He made a few grammatical mistakes.","cn":"他犯了一些文法錯誤。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288466 (CK) & #848739 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288466"}],"grand":[{"c":"The grand prize is a kiss from the princess.","cn":"一等奖是公主的香吻。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2038382 (JarHead54321) & #2027950 (ydcok)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2038382"}],"grandfather":[{"c":"My grandfather lived to be 90 years old.","cn":"我的祖父活到九十歲。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7782965 (sharris123) & #759061 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7782965"},{"c":"My grandfather usually eats breakfast at six.","cn":"我的祖父通常在六點鐘吃早餐。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321446 (CK) & #894942 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321446"}],"grandma":[{"c":"My grandma gave me this necklace.","cn":"这条项链是我奶奶送给我的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2737507 (CM) & #2737442 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2737507"},{"c":"Grandma likes watching TV.","cn":"祖母非常喜欢看电视。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #838811 (Scott) & #423395 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/838811"}],"grandmother":[{"c":"Grandmother sent us a box of apples.","cn":"奶奶送了我們一箱蘋果。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #273910 (CK) & #798191 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/273910"},{"c":"Her grandmother lived to be 88 years old.","cn":"她的祖母活到了88岁。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1495364 (weihaiping) & #472811 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1495364"}],"grandpa":[{"c":"Grandpa bought it for me!","cn":"爷爷买给我的！","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #73932 (CK) & #334262 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/73932"},{"c":"My grandpa believes that the moon landing was a hoax.","cn":"我的祖父相信登月是一個騙局。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1682994 (Spamster) & #7832322 (Leolaaziano)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1682994"}],"grandson":[{"c":"My grandson is still a baby.","cn":"我的孫子還是個嬰兒。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #814624 (brauliobezerra) & #816816 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/814624"}],"grape":[{"c":"That isn't wine. It's grape juice.","cn":"這不是葡萄酒，是葡萄汁。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4904143 (Shangri_La93) & #8824099 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4904143"},{"c":"I like grape jelly best.","cn":"葡萄味的果凍是我最喜歡的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #261563 (CK) & #8824089 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/261563"}],"grasp":[{"c":"He has a good grasp of English.","cn":"他精通英文。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #294020 (CK) & #884194 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/294020"}],"grass":[{"c":"Cows are eating grass in the meadow.","cn":"牛在草地上吃牧草。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #19510 (CK) & #471043 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/19510"},{"c":"My dog often lies on the grass.","cn":"我家的狗經常躺在草地上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #250768 (Eldad) & #8388697 (wangchou)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/250768"}],"grateful":[{"c":"I am grateful to you for your kindness.","cn":"谢谢您的好意。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #54402 (CK) & #8780278 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/54402"},{"c":"I'm extremely grateful to you.","cn":"我無法表達我對你的感謝。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #836578 (CM) & #836577 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/836578"}],"gratify":[{"c":"Always do right. This will gratify some people and astonish the rest.","cn":"坚持做对的事情。这会满足一部分人同时使另一部分人感到惊讶。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #667887 (CK) & #2426074 (huangfen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/667887"}],"grave":[{"c":"She carried that habit to her grave.","cn":"她到死都改不了那個習慣。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #311294 (CK) & #779054 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/311294"},{"c":"They were buried in a mass grave.","cn":"他们被埋在一座大坟墓里。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7120423 (CM) & #8748608 (cxpadonis)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7120423"}],"gravity":[{"c":"Gravity brings everything down to Earth.","cn":"重力将一切带下地球表面。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681099 (Source_VOA) & #3338908 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681099"},{"c":"It's gravity that makes satellites move around the Earth.","cn":"让卫星环绕地球的是重力。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1582751 (CM) & #1582748 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1582751"}],"great":[{"c":"A great many people attended his funeral.","cn":"很多人都参加了他的葬礼。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #287040 (Eldad) & #2065349 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/287040"},{"c":"Agriculture consumes a great amount of water.","cn":"農業需要消耗大量的水。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #282303 (CM) & #5640777 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/282303"}],"greater":[{"c":"Maternal love is greater than anything else.","cn":"母爱比任何别的东西都伟大。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #320590 (CK) & #5698047 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/320590"},{"c":"The population of London is much greater than that of any other British city.","cn":"倫敦的人口遠遠多於其他英國城市的人口。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #29283 (CK) & #5363942 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/29283"}],"greatly":[{"c":"She failed the examination and I was greatly disappointed.","cn":"令我非常伤心的是她考砸了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #41222 (CM) & #6315382 (yuiyu)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/41222"}],"greece":[{"c":"Greece is an old country.","cn":"希腊是个古老的国家。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3935488 (CM) & #7012159 (basilhan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3935488"}],"greedy":[{"c":"Tom certainly is greedy.","cn":"湯姆確實貪。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1095422 (CK) & #9480683 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1095422"}],"greek":[{"c":"That was all Greek to me.","cn":"我完全看不懂。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #426943 (blay_paul) & #760717 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/426943"},{"c":"It's all Greek to me.","cn":"看起来像天书。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #249797 (Zifre) & #426700 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/249797"}],"green":[{"c":"Apples are usually green, yellow, or red.","cn":"蘋果通常是綠色、黃色或紅色。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2976130 (patgfisher) & #13539405 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2976130"},{"c":"The light changed from red to green.","cn":"燈由紅變綠。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #272443 (CK) & #900686 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/272443"}],"greenhouse":[{"c":"They grow strawberries in their greenhouse.","cn":"他們在他們的溫室裡種植草莓。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #306209 (CK) & #802027 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/306209"},{"c":"Some scientists believe that the greenhouse effect is imaginary.","cn":"有的科學家認為溫室效應是虛構的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #727306 (CM) & #727307 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/727306"}],"greet":[{"c":"People, old and young, all came out to greet the guests.","cn":"无论老幼，人们都出来迎接贵客。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1577333 (CM) & #1577265 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1577333"},{"c":"He was aware that I was around, but didn't come to greet me.","cn":"他注意到我在場，但是沒向我打招呼。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2260086 (FeuDRenais) & #2256373 (cienias)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2260086"}],"grip":[{"c":"Get a grip on yourself.","cn":"冷静下来！","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2986061 (CK) & #5640761 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2986061"},{"c":"I'm losing my grip.","cn":"我失去了控制。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2548703 (CK) & #3779054 (e78xx_xxx)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2548703"}],"ground":[{"c":"We saw the ground covered with snow.","cn":"我们看见地面被雪覆盖了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #277260 (CK) & #2518664 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/277260"},{"c":"You can dig dirt from the ground.","cn":"你可以在地上挖土。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681107 (Source_VOA) & #5556193 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681107"}],"group":[{"c":"A group of young men were fighting.","cn":"一群年輕人在打架。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #265803 (CK) & #864462 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/265803"},{"c":"The birds were flying in a group.","cn":"鸟儿成群飞着。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #278195 (mamat) & #336449 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/278195"}],"grow":[{"c":"Nothing seems to grow in this soil.","cn":"這個土壤似乎長不出任何東西來。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #57684 (CK) & #891120 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/57684"},{"c":"Where in Australia did you grow up?","cn":"你在澳洲的哪裡長大?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65150 (CK) & #900263 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65150"}],"growing":[{"c":"You should try growing your own food.","cn":"你應該試試自己種植食物。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4499085 (CK) & #13109405 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4499085"},{"c":"My father's hobby is growing roses.","cn":"我父親的嗜好是種玫瑰花。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #318909 (CK) & #861445 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/318909"}],"growth":[{"c":"More money for education will spur economic growth.","cn":"更多投資在教育的錢將會刺激經濟成長。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #19132 (Zifre) & #772166 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/19132"},{"c":"The third quarter GNP growth was 1% over the preceding quarter.","cn":"第三季國民生產總值較上一季成長了1％。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #276020 (CK) & #830321 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/276020"}],"grumpy":[{"c":"Tom won't likely be grumpy again today.","cn":"汤姆今天脾气不太可能会那么坏了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6246363 (CK) & #8743672 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6246363"},{"c":"Tom is a grumpy old man.","cn":"汤姆是个脾气暴躁的老人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1934784 (Spamster) & #8743670 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1934784"}],"guarantee":[{"c":"They guarantee this clock for a year.","cn":"他們保證這個時鐘可用一年。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #58948 (CK) & #801932 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/58948"},{"c":"We guarantee our products for one year.","cn":"我們保證我們的產品一年。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #320483 (CK) & #802016 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/320483"}],"guard":[{"c":"Don't let your guard down.","cn":"不要放松警惕。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1123492 (Scott) & #9962879 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1123492"}],"guess":[{"c":"Can you guess how old I am?","cn":"你能猜到我的年龄吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4755353 (garborg) & #333677 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4755353"},{"c":"Can you guess what I have here?","cn":"你能猜到我有什么吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4755172 (garborg) & #333142 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4755172"}],"guide":[{"c":"I'll act as a guide for you.","cn":"我为你充当导游。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #246418 (CK) & #1446898 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/246418"},{"c":"Don't blame the tour guide.","cn":"不要怪導遊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10251104 (bekindtoall) & #3147869 (cienias)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10251104"}],"guilt":[{"c":"She had a vague feeling of guilt.","cn":"她隱約地有一種的內疚感。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #308728 (CK) & #796055 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/308728"},{"c":"I'm afraid he will never admit his guilt.","cn":"恐怕他永远也不会承认自己的罪行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300612 (CK) & #4789602 (400S)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300612"}],"guilty":[{"c":"She declared that she was not guilty.","cn":"她声称自己没罪。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #314757 (CK) & #787382 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/314757"},{"c":"Do you have a guilty conscience?","cn":"是你心里有鬼吧？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3825583 (CK) & #1766316 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3825583"}],"guitar":[{"c":"He is able to play the guitar.","cn":"他會彈吉他。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289619 (CK) & #883290 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289619"},{"c":"I broke a string on my guitar.","cn":"我弄断了我吉他的一根弦。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #340462 (fendtwick) & #392250 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/340462"}],"gum":[{"c":"Some gum stuck to his shoes.","cn":"口香糖粘到他的鞋子上了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #63568 (CK) & #8940749 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/63568"},{"c":"Some chewing gum was stuck to the sole of Tom's shoe.","cn":"汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10626017 (sundown) & #8673761 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10626017"}],"gun":[{"c":"I aimed my gun at the target.","cn":"我把我的手枪指向了目标。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321899 (CK) & #438491 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321899"},{"c":"Put the gun on the table.","cn":"把槍放在桌子上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #46688 (CK) & #798153 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/46688"}],"gunpowder":[{"c":"A spark caused the gunpowder to explode.","cn":"一点火花让火药爆炸。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7805889 (AlanF_US) & #10696003 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7805889"},{"c":"Do you know who invented gunpowder?","cn":"你们知道谁发明了火药吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2847969 (CK) & #9970061 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2847969"}],"guy":[{"c":"I think you're a really nice guy.","cn":"我認為你真的是一個好人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #68938 (CK) & #887707 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/68938"},{"c":"Don't get involved with that guy.","cn":"別和這個人打交道。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2306766 (CM) & #2301839 (cienias)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2306766"}],"gym":[{"c":"Are you going to the gym today?","cn":"你今天去不去健身房？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2135459 (CM) & #2135460 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2135459"},{"c":"I'm going to register at a gym.","cn":"我去註冊一家健身房。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7156267 (Kiwi) & #6999507 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7156267"}]}
